flowchart LR
    U[User browser] -->|HTTPS| CF{S3 website\nor CloudFront + OAC}
    CF -->|"POST /notes\nGET /notes\nGET /notes/{id}"| API[HTTP API]
    API -->|POST /notes| FN1[Create Lambda]
    API -->|"GET /notes/{id}"| FN2[Get Lambda]
    API -->|"GET /notes\n?q= &tag="| FN3[List Lambda\nno KMS access]
    FN1 -->|GenerateDataKey| KMS[(KMS customer key)]
    FN2 -->|Decrypt| KMS
    FN1 -->|PutItem ciphertext\n+ tags + TTL| DDB[(DynamoDB\nnoteId PK\nTTL: expiresAt)]
    FN2 -->|GetItem| DDB
    FN3 -->|Scan metadata only| DDB
    FN1 -.->|logs: noteId only| CW[CloudWatch Logs]
    FN2 -.->|logs: noteId only| CW
    FN3 -.->|logs: counts only| CW
